			armMargin: "Margin must be a number",
			armFloor: "Floor cannot be negative",
			armPeriodicCap: "Enter periodic cap",
			armLifetimeCap: "Lifetime cap cannot be more than 100%",
		});
		expect(result).toBeNull();
	});

